    <string name="help_intro">Press the keys 1, 2 and 3 to build a combo, then ⚔ to unleash it. Combat moves on in ticks of 1 second, and each combo acts over several ticks. Below a certain health, bosses turn to defence: they shield and heal themselves every second, and some rivals heal when their health runs low; stunning them cuts their healing short.

Chains: cast the combos of one family in order, from tier 1 to tier 4, and each link adds a bonus. Repeating the same tier or switching family breaks the chain; repeating tier 4 keeps the bonus.

Daze: each Stun raises the chance of dazing the rival, and a dazed rival is locked out for 10 s.

Only one multiplier and one shield can be active at a time.</string>
